bqxiSOtb_sC3SxsZgVTGww-RNT4cA&oe=6AE099F9"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "cover.png", "id": "1541414840969897", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491828104_1541414847636563_2863723104942724756_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=6d2V6Js2BAkQ7kNvwEkmgnD&_nc_oc=AdpFJaTgHL4udYYbPIh8_ffHWtEZslIpRRmxXcYRv5d2E54aArtgSEMqw-nkdx1AWjA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQM0m9S-XSC3YQIaGc2e7ueaU8HHHAvXkca3Fk_cdH9_Kg&oe=6AE0C220"}, "display_name": "Discovery: Rogue Planet", "keywords": ["FPS", "scifi", "shooter", "aliens", "action"], "long_description": "Set on **Rogax, a hostile frontier planet** filled with dangerous creatures, abandoned settlements, guarded cities, forgotten mines, and eerie swamps.\n\nYou play as a bounty hunter trying to make a living in a world where survival is never guaranteed. Take on risky jobs, fight aggressive alien threats, explore hostile environments, and uncover the secrets hidden across the planet.\n{1710710609997281}\n**Key Features**\n\n* **Full single-player VR campaign.** A narrative-driven sci-fi shooter experience built for players who want a real campaign in VR.\n* **First-person sci-fi combat.** Battle strange creatures and hostile threats with immersive VR shooting.\n* **Explore Rogax.** Discover dusty outposts, guarded cities, abandoned settlements, forgotten mines, and eerie swamps.\n* **Bounty hunter fantasy.** Take on dangerous jobs and survive a world where people do not always play by the rules.\n* **Mystery and discovery.**  Uncover the truth behind Rogax as each mission pulls you deeper into danger.\n\nSurvive the Frontier\n{1809776823549697}\nRogax is not a safe place.\n\nEvery job has a cost.\nEvery discovery has consequences.\nAnd every fight could be your last.\n", "short_description": "Rogax is alive, and it wants your next step to be our last. Blast through alien threats, explore a deadly frontier planet, and uncover